  ('AUD-04E905110P', 4, 'Straight fix for a rough idle', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2015 S4 B8 before ordering. I replaced all four at once rather than chase them one at a time. The part number on the body matches the OE reference exactly. Result is fuel economy went back to normal within a tank. Delivery was quick too.', 'Nadia Vogel', true, TRUE, '2026-06-19T17:49:31.407Z'),
