  ('AUD-04E905110P', 3, 'Fixed it, but not for long', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the RS4 B7. Coil pack out, new one in, ten minutes with a T30 and the engine cover off. It started misfiring on the same cylinder again after about eight weeks. That said, the rough idle and flashing engine light disappeared immediately. Would still buy it again.', 'Owen Brandt', true, TRUE, '2025-07-26T00:43:34.273Z'),
  ('AUD-04E905110P', 1, 'Boot split on installation', 'My Q7 4M needed this doing at 111k miles. The boot tore as I seated it, which suggests the rubber compound is not right. I cleared the fault codes afterwards and they have not come back. Would not order the same one again.', 'Claire Marchetti', true, TRUE, '2025-07-01T01:11:42.792Z'),
  ('AUD-04E905110P', 5, 'Exactly like the originals', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2012 A4 B8.5 before ordering. A smear of dielectric grease went on the boot before it was seated. The spring contact is firm and seated with a definite click. Result is the rough idle and flashing engine light disappeared immediately.', 'Talia Mensah', true, TRUE, '2025-08-09T00:58:18.852Z'),
  ('AUD-058905261A', 3, 'Good coil, slow shipping', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A3 8V. A smear of dielectric grease went on the boot before it was seated. The spring contact is firm and seated with a definite click. On balance it pulls cleanly through the rev range again with no stumble under load. Would still buy it again.', 'Jonas Ellery', true, TRUE, '2026-06-25T20:20:12.606Z'),
