  ('AUD-1J0615301M', 5, 'Solid replacement discs', 'Replacement for my 2010 A4 B8 2.0 TFSI. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Simone Petrov', true, TRUE, '2026-03-09T10:43:33.174Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301M', 5, 'No more steering shudder', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A6 C6. Thickness came in bang on the OE figure when I measured it. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Happy to recommend it.', 'Laura Novotny', true, TRUE, '2025-08-26T10:24:16.634Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301M', 1, 'Warped inside 3000 miles', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q8 4M. They developed a pulsing through the pedal well before they should have. Would not order the same one again.', 'Lena Brandt', true, TRUE, '2025-05-27T20:35:05.903Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301M', 5, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Went on my Q8 4M 3.0 TFSI V6 at 149k miles. An independent specialist fitted them and commented on how clean the castings were. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Result is the steering wheel shimmy under braking from motorway speed has completely gone. No complaints at all.', 'Rajesh Ellery', true, TRUE, '2025-11-30T12:24:33.887Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301M', 3, 'Fine at first, pulsing later', 'Went on my TT 8J 2.5 TFSI at 110k miles. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. They developed a pulsing through the pedal well before they should have. That said, no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Camille Delgado', true, TRUE, '2026-05-17T08:23:20.906Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301P', 4, 'Exactly the right spec', 'My A7 4G needed this doing at 162k miles. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Swapped them on the driveway with basic tools in about two hours a side. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Cannot fault it.', 'Callum Rossi', false, TRUE, '2026-05-22T09:10:48.661Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301P', 3, 'Noisy for the first week', 'My A5 F5 needed this doing at 115k miles. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. They never fully stopped squealing no matter how carefully I bedded them. That said, no squeal at all, even cold on a damp morning. Would still buy it again.', 'Emre Larsen', false, TRUE, '2025-11-06T05:38:06.825Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301P', 5, 'Bedded in perfectly', 'Ordered this for my A6 C8 after the original gave up at 129k. Needed a wind-back tool for the rear calipers but otherwise a straightforward job. Thickness came in bang on the OE figure when I measured it. Result is no squeal at all, even cold on a damp morning.', 'Rania Marchetti', true, TRUE, '2026-08-13T12:42:06.737Z'),
  ('AUD-1J0615301P', 5, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Fitted to my 2019 TT 8S. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Will be back for the other side.', 'Nadia Novotny', true, TRUE, '2025-06-04T03:56:31.213Z'),
