  ('AUD-1K0411105BT', 3, 'Good damping, ride height is off', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A8 D4. Top mounts and bearings went on at the same time while it was apart. The car sat about 15mm lower on one side, which suggests a spring rate problem. That said, it tracks straight on the motorway instead of wandering. Would still buy it again.', 'Simone Vogel', true, TRUE, '2025-12-23T03:05:20.553Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0411105BT', 4, 'Night and day difference', 'Bought for a 2024 Q8 4M. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. I torqued everything at ride height rather than with the suspension hanging. Result is sharp expansion joints no longer send a bang through the cabin. Exactly what I needed.', 'Laura Tran', true, TRUE, '2026-03-18T19:03:49.956Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0411105BT', 3, 'One weeped, the other is fine', 'Replacement for my 2010 A5 8T 3.0 TDI V6. I fitted both sides together as you should, then had it aligned the same week. One unit was visibly weeping oil down the body within a few weeks. That said, the car no longer floats over crests and settles in one movement. Would still buy it again.', 'Elena Lindqvist', true, TRUE, '2026-04-21T19:57:16.928Z'),
