  ('AUD-1K0615301AR', 5, 'Bedded in perfectly', 'Replacement for my 2013 A8 D4 3.0 TDI V6. Runout measured well within spec on the dial gauge. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Result is the steering wheel shimmy under braking from motorway speed has completely gone. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Stefan Rossi', false, TRUE, '2025-07-26T15:55:19.401Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0615301AR', 2, 'Wrong offset for my car', 'My Q3 8U needed this doing at 87k miles. The offset was not what the listing stated and it fouled the caliper carrier. Expected better given the cost.', 'Malik Novotny', false, TRUE, '2026-01-14T03:18:13.342Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0615301AR', 5, 'Pedal feel transformed', 'Bought for a 2017 A3 8V. An independent specialist fitted them and commented on how clean the castings were. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is no squeal at all, even cold on a damp morning. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Nadia Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2025-03-19T12:24:32.077Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0615301AR', 5, 'Exactly the right spec', 'Bought for a 2015 S3 8V. Swapped them on the driveway with basic tools in about two hours a side. Runout measured well within spec on the dial gauge. Result is eight months and several thousand miles later they are still dead smooth. Happy to recommend it.', 'Owen Delgado', true, TRUE, '2025-06-12T18:09:40.665Z'),
  ('AUD-1K0615301AR', 2, 'Never stopped squealing', 'Ordered this for my TT 8J after the original gave up at 59k. They never fully stopped squealing no matter how carefully I bedded them. Swapped them on the driveway with basic tools in about two hours a side. Would not order the same one again.', 'Lena Duarte', true, TRUE, '2025-09-11T04:28:22.461Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 4, 'Straight, true and quiet', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A7 4G. An independent specialist fitted them and commented on how clean the castings were. Thickness came in bang on the OE figure when I measured it. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed.', 'Nora Sorensen', false, TRUE, '2026-07-08T21:35:20.563Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 3, 'Fine at first, pulsing later', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q5 FY. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. They developed a pulsing through the pedal well before they should have. That said, the steering wheel shimmy under braking from motorway speed has completely gone. Would still buy it again.', 'Patrick Lindqvist', true, TRUE, '2026-01-21T16:28:02.352Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 4, 'Judder gone completely', 'Bought for a 2017 A6 C7. Weight and vane count match the originals exactly. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed. Exactly what I needed.', 'Zara Ferreira', false, TRUE, '2025-11-06T05:55:44.127Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 4, 'Pedal feel transformed', 'Went on my Q5 8R 2.0 TDI at 98k miles. Carrier bolts came off without a fight and the new discs dropped straight on. The protective coating on the hat means no unsightly rust ring after a wash. Result is braking is quiet and progressive where before it grabbed.', 'Nora Mensah', true, TRUE, '2026-04-25T05:13:06.772Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 4, 'Solid replacement discs', 'My Q7 4M needed this doing at 91k miles. Took my time bedding them in over 200 miles as the instructions ask. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Result is the steering wheel shimmy under braking from motorway speed has completely gone. Delivery was quick too.', 'Marcus Rossi', true, TRUE, '2025-09-12T19:21:50.428Z'),
  ('AUD-2Q0615601H', 5, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Bought for a 2012 A6 C7. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is the steering wheel shimmy under braking from motorway speed has completely gone.', 'Adrian Rahman', true, TRUE, '2026-06-23T01:10:13.271Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AD', 3, 'Lovely wheel, needs spigot rings', 'Fitted to my 2011 S4 B8. They bolted straight on with the factory bolts and centred perfectly on the hub. Weight per corner is genuinely lower than the wheels I took off. On balance no vibration at any speed, right up to motorway limits. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Talia Halvorsen', false, TRUE, '2025-10-03T06:52:21.838Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AD', 4, 'Straight and true', 'Bought for a 2018 A5 F5. Weight per corner is genuinely lower than the wheels I took off. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. Result is the car sits exactly right with no arch rub on full lock. Exactly what I needed.', 'Claire Fitzgerald', true, TRUE, '2025-07-23T04:54:44.963Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AD', 4, 'Transformed the look', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the S4 B8. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. The lacquer is even and deep, with no orange peel anywhere on the face. Result is no vibration at any speed, right up to motorway limits.', 'Lena Haugen', false, TRUE, '2025-04-05T12:04:36.353Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AD', 5, 'Correct offset, no rubbing', 'Ordered this for my A1 8X after the original gave up at 82k. The lacquer is even and deep, with no orange peel anywhere on the face. Torqued to 120Nm in a star pattern and rechecked after 50 miles. Result is no vibration at any speed, right up to motorway limits. Exactly what I needed.', 'Owen Rahman', true, TRUE, '2026-07-08T03:41:15.348Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AD', 5, 'Finish is flawless', 'Replacement for my 2022 Q7 4M 3.0 TFSI V6. They bolted straight on with the factory bolts and centred perfectly on the hub. The machined face has a consistent finish under direct light. Result is it clears the front calipers with room to spare. Delivery was quick too.', 'Daniel Larsen', false, TRUE, '2025-03-19T19:23:17.124Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AF', 3, 'Great look, finish needs care', 'Went on my A3 8V 1.8 TFSI at 136k miles. I had them balanced when the tyres went on and they took almost no weight. The lacquer started lifting at the rim edge after a single winter. That said, they have been through a winter of salt without a mark on the finish. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Lukas Zimmer', true, TRUE, '2026-02-07T14:29:32.445Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AF', 5, 'Better than I expected', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q7 4M. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. Weight per corner is genuinely lower than the wheels I took off. Result is the car sits exactly right with no arch rub on full lock.', 'Rebecca Vance', true, TRUE, '2026-06-15T13:08:56.483Z'),
  ('AUD-420601025AF', 5, 'Straight and true', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A6 C7. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. The casting is clean with no flashing around the spokes or the bolt seats. Result is they have been through a winter of salt without a mark on the finish. No complaints at all.', 'Nadia Fitzgerald', true, TRUE, '2026-06-09T02:33:02.458Z'),
  ('AUD-420698451D', 3, 'Noisy for the first week', 'Fitted to my 2021 A6 C8. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. They never fully stopped squealing no matter how carefully I bedded them. That said, no squeal at all, even cold on a damp morning. Would still buy it again.', 'Daniel Kowalski', true, TRUE, '2026-03-06T00:29:47.354Z'),
  ('AUD-420698451D', 4, 'Straight, true and quiet', 'Ordered this for my A4 B8.5 after the original gave up at 159k. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. Result is stopping distance feels shorter and the pedal is firm rather than spongy.', 'Nora Okonkwo', false, TRUE, '2026-02-01T15:16:26.482Z'),
  ('AUD-420698451D', 4, 'Better than the dealer discs', 'Went on my A6 C7 3.0 TFSI V6 at 122k miles. Machining on the friction face is even all the way round. Swapped them on the driveway with basic tools in about two hours a side. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Exactly what I needed.', 'Rania Halvorsen', true, TRUE, '2026-08-14T08:16:55.022Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 5, 'Bodyshop was impressed', 'Went on my Q7 4L 1.8 TFSI at 127k miles. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. All the mounting tabs and clip locations are present and in the right place. Result is the paint match came out perfectly with no ripple in the reflection. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Yusuf Moreau', true, TRUE, '2025-05-04T20:31:13.066Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 2, 'Mounting tab snapped off', 'Went on my A3 8P 2.5 TFSI at 119k miles. One of the mounting tabs sheared as soon as it was put under any tension. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. Expected better given the cost.', 'Felix Zimmer', false, TRUE, '2026-08-15T06:47:35.749Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 4, 'Primed and ready to paint', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2011 A6 C7 before ordering. It clipped into the factory mounting points without drilling anything. All the mounting tabs and clip locations are present and in the right place. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Delivery was quick too.', 'Elena Kaur', false, TRUE, '2025-11-21T11:36:52.929Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 2, 'Creased in transit', 'Ordered this for my A5 8T after the original gave up at 58k. It arrived with a crease along one edge because the packaging was inadequate. Would not order the same one again.', 'Sofia Fitzgerald', true, TRUE, '2025-07-08T06:53:13.757Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 3, 'Good panel, treat the tabs gently', 'Fitted to my 2009 A3 8P. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. One of the mounting tabs sheared as soon as it was put under any tension. That said, it has been on a year now with no sign of corrosion at the seams. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Rajesh Novotny', false, TRUE, '2025-08-16T14:30:55.202Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 3, 'Good panel, treat the tabs gently (Q8 4M)', 'Fitted to my 2020 Q8 4M. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. One of the mounting tabs sheared as soon as it was put under any tension. That said, it has been on a year now with no sign of corrosion at the seams. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Viktor Bauer', false, TRUE, '2026-06-11T11:38:25.328Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 4, 'Contours match exactly', 'My A3 8V needed this doing at 94k miles. It clipped into the factory mounting points without drilling anything. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. Result is the paint match came out perfectly with no ripple in the reflection.', 'Freya Novotny', true, TRUE, '2026-02-02T21:05:29.744Z'),
  ('AUD-420810439A', 4, 'Saved a fortune on the repair', 'My Q5 8R needed this doing at 66k miles. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. The steel gauge feels the same as the original panel we cut out. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired.', 'Nora Halvorsen', false, TRUE, '2026-05-07T21:21:42.999Z'),
  ('AUD-4E0121212B', 3, 'Fits, but budget a new fan shroud', 'Fitted to my 2009 Q5 8R. Front end off, old one out, this one in over a long Saturday. The core is thicker than the unit it replaced and the fin density is noticeably higher. On balance the gauge sits dead centre now even in traffic on a hot day. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Yara Osei', true, TRUE, '2025-09-26T22:57:38.487Z'),
  ('AUD-4E0121212B', 3, 'Works, but watch the seams', 'Ordered this for my A3 8P after the original gave up at 95k. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. A weep appeared at the end tank seam after a few heat cycles. That said, the gauge sits dead centre now even in traffic on a hot day. Good part, minor niggles.', 'Kwame Ibrahim', false, TRUE, '2026-06-14T11:33:39.496Z'),
  ('AUD-4E0121212B', 4, 'Straight swap', 'Ordered this for my A4 B8.5 after the original gave up at 142k. I pressure tested it to 1.4 bar before fitting and it held without a drop. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. Result is the gauge sits dead centre now even in traffic on a hot day.', 'Elena Novak', true, TRUE, '2026-06-15T18:14:36.957Z'),
  ('AUD-4E0121212B', 5, 'Holds pressure beautifully', 'Went on my Q5 FY 2.0 TDI at 79k miles. The core is thicker than the unit it replaced and the fin density is noticeably higher. I flushed the system properly and refilled with the correct G13 before bleeding. Result is intake temps dropped noticeably on a long motorway pull. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Greta Weiss', true, TRUE, '2026-07-12T22:23:48.497Z'),
