  ('AUD-4E0121212B', 2, 'Fins bent in transit', 'Bought for a 2020 A6 C8. Several fins arrived flattened because the box had almost no internal padding. Expected better given the cost.', 'Camille Bauer', false, TRUE, '2025-10-11T12:34:52.131Z'),
