  ('AUD-4E0615601L', 5, 'Solid replacement discs', 'Ordered this for my A1 8X after the original gave up at 69k. The hub face cleaned up first, then these went on with no shimming needed. The vane casting is noticeably tidier than the budget set I pulled off. Result is no vibration through the pedal even on a long downhill run. Cannot fault it.', 'Tobias Adeyemi', true, TRUE, '2025-02-28T18:05:35.114Z'),
