  ('AUD-4S0823481', 4, 'Bodyshop was impressed', 'Ordered this for my A6 C8 after the original gave up at 130k. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Happy to recommend it.', 'Amara Vogel', true, TRUE, '2025-05-23T02:13:47.895Z'),
  ('AUD-4S0823481', 5, 'Saved a fortune on the repair', 'Fitted to my 2010 TT 8J. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. The swage lines and body contours follow the original exactly. Result is the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Rebecca Nair', true, TRUE, '2025-11-16T22:20:27.557Z'),
  ('AUD-4S0823481', 3, 'Fits well, arrived slightly marked', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A8 D4. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. It arrived with a crease along one edge because the packaging was inadequate. That said, the finished repair cost a fraction of a dealer panel. Would still buy it again.', 'Rania Bianchi', true, TRUE, '2025-08-19T13:17:47.830Z'),
