  ('AUD-5Q0129620B', 5, 'Exactly what the service needed', 'Went on my Q8 4M 3.0 TFSI V6 at 166k miles. The media feels dense and the end caps are properly bonded rather than glued on thin. I changed it with the oil at the same service interval. Result is shifts are smoother now the transmission has clean fluid and a fresh filter. No complaints at all.', 'Kwame Brandt', false, TRUE, '2025-06-15T12:15:11.753Z'),
  ('AUD-5Q0129620B', 3, 'Right filter, tight in the housing', 'Went on my A4 B8.5 3.0 TDI V6 at 67k miles. It dropped straight into the housing and the cap torqued to spec first go. The outer diameter was a couple of millimetres off and it would not sit square in the housing. That said, oil pressure comes up as quickly on a cold start as it always has. Would still buy it again.', 'Lukas Krause', true, TRUE, '2026-02-04T03:24:37.796Z'),
  ('AUD-5Q0411105HT', 5, 'Car feels new again', 'Fitted to my 2011 A8 D4. I fitted both sides together as you should, then had it aligned the same week. Damping is progressive when you compress it by hand, not dead at the top of the stroke. Result is the clonk over speed bumps that started this job has completely gone.', 'Chidi Osei', true, TRUE, '2025-04-13T21:58:32.080Z'),
  ('AUD-5Q0411105HT', 5, 'Crashing over potholes has stopped', 'Went on my A4 B9 3.0 TFSI V6 at 108k miles. I torqued everything at ride height rather than with the suspension hanging. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. Result is the car no longer floats over crests and settles in one movement. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Yusuf Halvorsen', true, TRUE, '2026-06-09T00:46:20.363Z'),
  ('AUD-5Q0411105HT', 5, 'Night and day difference', 'Went on my A4 B8 2.0 TFSI at 132k miles. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. The garage did the pair and the alignment came back within spec straight away. Result is body roll through roundabouts is properly controlled again. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Hugo Ellery', false, TRUE, '2026-02-11T22:24:52.837Z'),
  ('AUD-5Q0411105HT', 5, 'Ride is composed again', 'Ordered this for my A6 C8 after the original gave up at 41k. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. I torqued everything at ride height rather than with the suspension hanging. Result is the clonk over speed bumps that started this job has completely gone. No complaints at all.', 'Adrian Castellanos', true, TRUE, '2026-03-06T13:14:32.449Z'),
