  ('AUD-82A941003', 4, 'Beam pattern matches the original', 'Fitted to my 2019 Q8 4M. The levelling motor transferred across from the old unit without trouble. The internal reflector finish looks the same as the unit that came off. Result is the cut-off is sharp and sits exactly where the old one did. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Bastian Silva', true, TRUE, '2025-08-30T06:42:15.650Z'),
  ('AUD-82A941003', 5, 'Clear lens, proper seal (Q7 4L)', 'Bought for a 2008 Q7 4L. The mounting tabs are moulded thick enough that they do not flex when bolted down. The levelling motor transferred across from the old unit without trouble. Result is the output is far better than the yellowed original it replaced.', 'Malik Nair', true, TRUE, '2025-09-01T19:39:43.311Z'),
