  ('AUD-8V0941700F', 5, 'Beam pattern matches the original', 'My RS4 B7 needed this doing at 96k miles. The levelling motor transferred across from the old unit without trouble. The internal reflector finish looks the same as the unit that came off. Result is the output is far better than the yellowed original it replaced. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Lukas Haugen', true, TRUE, '2026-06-09T04:38:35.264Z'),
  ('AUD-8V0941700F', 5, 'Clear lens, proper seal (A3 8V)', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2013 A3 8V before ordering. The three bolts went straight into the original captive nuts. The lens is properly clear rather than the slightly milky finish of the cheap copies. Result is no condensation at all through a wet winter.', 'Callum Haugen', true, TRUE, '2026-02-23T04:57:58.153Z'),
  ('AUD-8V0941700F', 5, 'Plugged straight in (A4 B9)', 'Went on my A4 B9 2.0 TDI at 141k miles. The internal reflector finish looks the same as the unit that came off. The bumper had to come off, but the mounting tabs lined up exactly. Result is the indicator and daytime running light behave exactly like the factory part. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Patrick Bergmann', true, TRUE, '2025-10-04T09:05:17.699Z'),
  ('AUD-8V0941700F', 5, 'Ended my condensation problem (A6 C8)', 'Fitted to my 2022 A6 C8. The three bolts went straight into the original captive nuts. The internal reflector finish looks the same as the unit that came off. Result is the cut-off is sharp and sits exactly where the old one did. Delivery was quick too.', 'Lukas Moreau', false, TRUE, '2025-10-14T04:17:48.489Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 3, 'Lights fine, seal is thin', 'My S3 8V needed this doing at 165k miles. The loom plugged in without any splicing. The supplied gasket was too thin and let a little water into the housing. That said, from a few paces back you cannot tell which side was replaced. Good part, minor niggles.', 'Claire Bianchi', true, TRUE, '2026-02-17T20:20:19.193Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 4, 'Colour matches the other side', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A4 B9. It took about twenty minutes with the boot trim folded back. The bulb holders click in positively instead of feeling loose. Result is from a few paces back you cannot tell which side was replaced.', 'Priya Moreau', true, TRUE, '2026-01-20T18:57:01.831Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 5, 'Sealed properly', 'Went on my A6 C7 2.5 TFSI at 82k miles. The loom plugged in without any splicing. The housing feels rigid and does not creak when the bolts are tightened. Result is no moisture inside after months of use.', 'Chidi Lindqvist', true, TRUE, '2025-08-16T16:43:06.248Z'),
