  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 5, 'Colour matches the other side (TT 8S)', 'Replacement for my 2022 TT 8S 1.4 TFSI. The housing feels rigid and does not creak when the bolts are tightened. The loom plugged in without any splicing. Result is every LED segment lights evenly with no dark patches. Delivery was quick too.', 'Hannah Bergmann', false, TRUE, '2025-10-13T10:31:53.916Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 4, 'Straight swap (A6 C6)', 'Bought for a 2010 A6 C6. The loom plugged in without any splicing. The housing feels rigid and does not creak when the bolts are tightened. Result is from a few paces back you cannot tell which side was replaced. Delivery was quick too.', 'Laura Adeyemi', false, TRUE, '2025-10-16T03:44:30.169Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945095D', 5, 'Straight swap (A6 C6)', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A6 C6. Two nuts behind the trim panel and the whole unit came away. The gasket is a proper moulded seal rather than a strip of foam. Result is every LED segment lights evenly with no dark patches. No complaints at all.', 'Anders Ibrahim', true, TRUE, '2025-02-28T06:59:30.992Z'),
