  ('AUD-8V4945096D', 5, 'Sealed properly', 'Went on my A6 C6 2.0 TFSI at 54k miles. The locating pegs dropped into the body holes first time. The gasket is a proper moulded seal rather than a strip of foam. Result is the car threw no bulb-out warning on the dash. Exactly what I needed.', 'Priya Ferreira', false, TRUE, '2026-02-11T11:55:18.053Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945096D', 3, 'Good match, fiddly to seat', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2013 A4 B8.5 before ordering. The locating pegs dropped into the body holes first time. The red of the lens matches the untouched side exactly under daylight. On balance no moisture inside after months of use. Fine for the money, with that one caveat.', 'Jonas Vance', false, TRUE, '2025-08-15T13:36:45.797Z'),
  ('AUD-8V4945096D', 3, 'Mostly good, one dead segment', 'My TT 8S needed this doing at 47k miles. It took about twenty minutes with the boot trim folded back. One of the LED segments failed within a few weeks of fitting. That said, from a few paces back you cannot tell which side was replaced. Would still buy it again.', 'Aisha Larsen', true, TRUE, '2026-06-21T01:54:21.845Z'),
  ('AUD-8V5807329A', 4, 'Panel gaps came out perfect', 'Replacement for my 2016 Q7 4M 2.5 TFSI. I prepped and painted it in the car colour and it went on in a morning. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. Result is the paint match came out perfectly with no ripple in the reflection. Exactly what I needed.', 'Kwame Petrov', false, TRUE, '2026-02-04T06:23:11.190Z'),
  ('AUD-8V5807329A', 5, 'Lined up first time', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A4 B9. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. The swage lines and body contours follow the original exactly. Result is the finished repair cost a fraction of a dealer panel.', 'Priya Rossi', true, TRUE, '2026-02-05T06:51:58.246Z'),
  ('AUD-8V5807329A', 5, 'Primed and ready to paint', 'Bought for a 2009 A4 B8. The swage lines and body contours follow the original exactly. I lined it up against the door shut and the gap fell straight in. Result is it has been on a year now with no sign of corrosion at the seams.', 'Nadia Duarte', true, TRUE, '2025-06-24T00:41:39.983Z'),
  ('AUD-8V5807329A', 3, 'Good panel, treat the tabs gently', 'Bought for a 2007 A3 8P. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. One of the mounting tabs sheared as soon as it was put under any tension. That said, the panel gaps are even down both sides and you cannot tell it was repaired. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Amara Nair', true, TRUE, '2026-03-22T13:29:35.914Z'),
  ('AUD-8V5807329A', 5, 'Contours match exactly', 'Bought for a 2013 A7 4G. The bodyshop test-fitted it before paint and needed almost no adjustment. It came properly primed rather than in bare metal that would flash rust. Result is the paint match came out perfectly with no ripple in the reflection. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Rebecca Adeyemi', true, TRUE, '2026-03-21T16:36:59.279Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 3, 'Good sound, fiddly fitting', 'Ordered this for my RS4 B7 after the original gave up at 102k. I added a bit of sound deadening behind them while the door was open. The terminals are proper spade connectors that match the factory loom. On balance the door card buzz at higher volume has gone completely. Would still buy it again.', 'Nora Lindqvist', true, TRUE, '2025-10-05T00:41:36.763Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 3, 'Good sound, one was damaged', 'Went on my TT 8J 2.0 TFSI at 121k miles. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. One of the pair had a small tear in the surround out of the box. That said, the door card buzz at higher volume has gone completely. Good part, minor niggles.', 'Emre Sorensen', false, TRUE, '2026-03-09T16:39:37.983Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 4, 'Bass without the rattle', 'My Q8 4M needed this doing at 134k miles. The magnet is significantly larger than the factory unit. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. Result is the door card buzz at higher volume has gone completely. Would order again without hesitation.', 'Amara Novotny', true, TRUE, '2025-10-29T07:59:09.430Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 5, 'Clarity is a big step up', 'My Q8 4M needed this doing at 75k miles. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. The magnet is significantly larger than the factory unit. Result is vocals are clear at volume where the originals used to distort. Happy to recommend it.', 'Adrian Moreau', true, TRUE, '2025-09-07T10:35:40.061Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 5, 'Worth doing', 'Replacement for my 2017 S3 8V 3.0 TFSI V6. The cone and surround feel far more substantial than the paper originals. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. Result is vocals are clear at volume where the originals used to distort. Exactly what I needed.', 'Yusuf Kowalski', true, TRUE, '2025-06-08T03:33:41.243Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 4, 'Direct fit, no adapters', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2010 Q5 8R before ordering. Door card off, four screws, and the connector plugged straight in. The cone and surround feel far more substantial than the paper originals. Result is the door card buzz at higher volume has gone completely.', 'Rania Weiss', true, TRUE, '2026-03-21T18:10:51.682Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6035411A', 5, 'Clarity is a big step up (Q7 4L)', 'Replacement for my 2013 Q7 4L 3.0 TDI V6. I added a bit of sound deadening behind them while the door was open. The magnet is significantly larger than the factory unit. Result is vocals are clear at volume where the originals used to distort. Happy to recommend it.', 'Patrick Sorensen', true, TRUE, '2025-05-26T04:45:15.467Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031A', 5, 'Correct damping rate', 'Bought for a 2018 Q3 8U. The rod is properly finished with no machining marks and the seal is clean. Spring compressors out and the strut rebuilt on the bench in an afternoon. Result is body roll through roundabouts is properly controlled again. No complaints at all.', 'Freya Whitfield', false, TRUE, '2026-03-04T06:04:47.582Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031A', 5, 'Ride is composed again', 'Went on my RS4 B7 1.4 TFSI at 51k miles. The weight matches the original almost exactly, which the cheap ones never do. The garage did the pair and the alignment came back within spec straight away. Result is sharp expansion joints no longer send a bang through the cabin.', 'Yara Marchetti', false, TRUE, '2026-02-01T16:20:55.657Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031A', 1, 'Sat lower on one side', 'Bought for a 2022 Q7 4M. The car sat about 15mm lower on one side, which suggests a spring rate problem. Expected better given the cost.', 'Simone Weiss', false, TRUE, '2025-09-29T04:53:53.858Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031A', 4, 'Well damped, not harsh', 'Bought for a 2011 Q3 8U. The paint and plating look like they will survive a few winters of salt. The garage did the pair and the alignment came back within spec straight away. Result is the car no longer floats over crests and settles in one movement. Good value against the dealer price.', 'Anders Novak', false, TRUE, '2025-11-23T15:39:54.827Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031B', 2, 'Leaked within a month', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q7 4M. One unit was visibly weeping oil down the body within a few weeks. Disappointing for the price.', 'Claire Nair', false, TRUE, '2026-05-28T04:13:43.787Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031B', 5, 'Night and day difference', 'Went on my Q5 FY 2.0 TDI at 44k miles. The rod is properly finished with no machining marks and the seal is clean. The garage did the pair and the alignment came back within spec straight away. Result is sharp expansion joints no longer send a bang through the cabin. No complaints at all.', 'Yara Rahman', true, TRUE, '2026-04-09T10:27:35.317Z'),
  ('AUD-8W6413031B', 3, 'One weeped, the other is fine', 'My A6 C7 needed this doing at 159k miles. Top mounts and bearings went on at the same time while it was apart. One unit was visibly weeping oil down the body within a few weeks. That said, it tracks straight on the motorway instead of wandering. Would still buy it again.', 'Viktor Novak', true, TRUE, '2026-01-13T10:05:12.194Z'),
