  ('AUD-8X0941043', 4, 'Correct fit first time', 'Fitted to my 2016 S4 B8. The mounting tabs are moulded thick enough that they do not flex when bolted down. It plugged into the factory connector without an adapter. Result is it has passed an MOT since with no comment on the beam. Happy to recommend it.', 'Laura Rahman', false, TRUE, '2025-12-27T11:47:01.806Z'),
  ('AUD-8X0941043', 3, 'Right part, average finish', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2011 A3 8P before ordering. Swapping it over took an afternoon working carefully. The lens is properly clear rather than the slightly milky finish of the cheap copies. On balance the output is far better than the yellowed original it replaced. Worth buying, just go in with your eyes open.', 'Lena Nair', false, TRUE, '2026-01-23T19:07:04.078Z'),
  ('AUD-8X0941043', 3, 'Good light, one tab cracked', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the A4 B7. The three bolts went straight into the original captive nuts. One of the mounting tabs was cracked in transit and needed repairing before it would sit properly. That said, the output is far better than the yellowed original it replaced. Good part, minor niggles.', 'Mei Kowalski', true, TRUE, '2026-07-25T02:31:04.024Z'),
  ('AUD-8X0945093D', 3, 'Good match, fiddly to seat', 'Second one of these I have bought, this time for the Q8 4M. The locating pegs dropped into the body holes first time. The bulb holders click in positively instead of feeling loose. On balance no moisture inside after months of use. Would still buy it again.', 'Malik Novak', true, TRUE, '2025-12-23T10:09:23.590Z'),
  ('AUD-8X0945093D', 4, 'Colour matches the other side', 'Fitted to my 2017 A4 B9. It took about twenty minutes with the boot trim folded back. The housing feels rigid and does not creak when the bolts are tightened. Result is from a few paces back you cannot tell which side was replaced.', 'Callum Osei', false, TRUE, '2025-09-27T20:47:28.351Z'),
