  ('AUD-N10596201', 5, 'Correct thread, correct grade', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2008 TT 8J before ordering. The head marking and plating match the originals exactly. They threaded in cleanly by hand before I put a socket anywhere near them. Result is no corrosion on them after a winter of road salt. Delivery was quick too.', 'Sven Okonkwo', true, TRUE, '2025-08-14T11:23:34.583Z'),
