  ('AUD-N10621301', 5, 'Proper OE spec', 'Bought for a 2008 A4 B7. They threaded in cleanly by hand before I put a socket anywhere near them. The head marking and plating match the originals exactly. Result is everything torqued down evenly with nothing binding.', 'Aisha Osei', true, TRUE, '2026-02-11T13:39:54.624Z'),
