  ('AUD-ZAW601002', 5, 'Balanced with almost no weight', 'Cross-referenced the OE number against my 2011 Q7 4L before ordering. They needed spigot rings for a proper hub-centric fit, which are worth buying alongside. The casting is clean with no flashing around the spokes or the bolt seats. Result is it clears the front calipers with room to spare.', 'Lena Whitfield', true, TRUE, '2026-01-25T15:54:38.033Z'),
